{"id":"bb634ebca71bf364","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Conditional Probability Kernel","display":"df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure11 Conditional Probability Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure11 Conditional Probability Kernel","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","[[58-df-integral.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure11 Conditional Probability Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral.md\">58-df-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu\\in V\">\\(K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> (kernel, probability space, conditioning sigma-algebra, and measure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu\">\\(\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu\\)</span> 使用所引非负积分的函数图输入。其可测性由正文全部有理阈值逆像条件给出，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma\\)</span>；值域通过通常嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\\subseteq[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,1]\\subseteq[0,\\infty]\\)</span> 读取。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S(K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\Sigma})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),X,\\Sigma)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(B)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal G\\bigr)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\left(\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu=\\mu(B\\cap G)\\right)\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S(K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\Sigma})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),X,\\Sigma)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(B)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal G\\bigr)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\left(\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu=\\mu(B\\cap G)\\right)\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(x)\">\\(K(x)\\)</span> 是定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 上的概率测度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的集合值域可显式取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]^{\\Sigma}\">\\([0,1]^{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]\\subseteq[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11ConditionalProbabilityKernel}_S(K,X,\\Sigma,\\mathcal G,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,X)\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\Sigma})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),X,\\Sigma)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(B)>r\\}\\in\\mathcal G\\bigr)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall G\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\left(\\int_G\\{\\langle x,K(x)(B)\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\,d\\mu=\\mu(B\\cap G)\\right)\\right]\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"K(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]^{\\Sigma}","display":false}],"bytes":2226,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2554","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel.md|58-df-zfc-measure11-conditional-probability-kernel]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6","5e0db065132180df","4884f45058a56aac","36d7463d215be751"]}